        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    returns = [\n        15.4, -6.2, 7.8, -14.3, 12.0, -9.1, 18.5, 25.7, -5.0, 3.3,\n        21.2, -7.6, 11.7, 29.8, -19.4, 8.9, 4.5, -11.2, 6.6, -13.7\n    ]\n    winsor_percent = 0.10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    sorted_returns = sorted(returns)\n    count = int(len(sorted_returns) * winsor_percent)\n    if count:\n        lower_value = sorted_returns[count]\n        upper_value = sorted_returns[-count - 1]\n        winsorized_returns = (\n            [lower_value] * count\n            + sorted_returns[count:-count]\n            + [upper_value] * count\n        )\n    else:\n        winsorized_returns = sorted_returns\n\n    answer = round(sum(winsorized_returns) / len(winsorized_returns), 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
